#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:1
msgid "Migrating from sbt 1.x"
msgstr "从 sbt 1.x 迁移"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:3
msgid "Changing `build.sbt` DSL to Scala 3.x"
msgstr "将 `build.sbt` DSL 改为 Scala 3.x"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:5
msgid ""
"As a reminder, users can build either Scala 2.x or Scala 3.x programs using "
"either sbt 1.x or sbt 2.x. However, the Scala that underlies the `build.sbt` "
"DSL is determined by the sbt version. In sbt 2.0, we are migrating to Scala "
"3.8.x."
msgstr ""
"提醒一下，用户可以使用 sbt 1.x 或 sbt 2.x 构建 Scala 2.x 或 Scala 3.x 程序。"
"但 `build.sbt` DSL 所基于的 Scala 版本由 sbt 版本决定。在 sbt 2.0 中，我们正"
"在迁移到 Scala 3.8.x。"

#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:7
msgid ""
"This means that if you implement custom tasks or sbt plugins for sbt 2.x, it "
"must be done using Scala 3.x. Consult [Scala 3.x incompatibility table]"
"(https://docs.scala-lang.org/scala3/guides/migration/incompatibility-"
"table.html) and [Scala 2 with -Xsource:3](https://docs.scala-lang.org/scala3/"
"guides/migration/tooling-scala2-xsource3.html) for details about Scala 3.x."
msgstr ""
"这意味着如果您为 sbt 2.x 实现自定义任务或 sbt 插件，必须使用 Scala 3.x。有关 "
"Scala 3.x 的详细信息，请参阅 [Scala 3.x 不兼容性表](https://docs.scala-"
"lang.org/scala3/guides/migration/incompatibility-table.html) 和 [Scala 2 "
"with -Xsource:3](https://docs.scala-lang.org/scala3/guides/migration/tooling-"
"scala2-xsource3.html)。"

