#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:59
msgid ""
"_Bare settings_, like the example above, are settings written directly in "
"`build.sbt` without `settings(...)`."
msgstr ""
"如上例所示，_Bare settings_（裸设置）是直接在 `build.sbt` 中编写且不带 "
