#: src/reference/changes/migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md:61
msgid ""
"```admonish warning\n"
"In sbt 1.x bare settings were project settings that applied only to the root "
"subproject. In sbt 2.x, the bare settings in `build.sbt` are common settings "
"that are injected to **all subprojects**.\n"
